{"id":"5566894f58c3ced5","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSafeSubProof.md","title":"FSafeSubProof","display":"FSafeSubProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FSafeSubProof","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","x","s","t","u","z1311"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FSafeSubProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>x</span><span>s</span><span>t</span><span>u</span><span>z1311</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶语法与替换。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>x</code>、<code>s</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>、<code>z1311</code>。</p>\n<p>free-for 的无捕获替换图；非全定义，绝不默许变量捕获。：非空有限见证列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FSafeSubProof E F R f r x s t u z1311)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1314\n  (exists z1315\n    (and\n      (@ Seq z1311 z1314)\n      (and\n        (@ Last z1311 z1315)\n        (and\n          (exists z1346\n            (and (exists z1347 (and (@ Pair t u z1347) (@ Pair s z1347 z1346))) (@ Pair x z1346 z1315)))\n          (forall z1312\n            (implies\n              (in z1312 z1314)\n              (exists z1313 (and (@ App z1311 z1312 z1313) (@ FSafeSubRow E F R f r z1311 z1312 z1313))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" 